## Important Rules
- State your intent before calling tools
- To enter text, first call `tap_element` on the field, then call `input_text` with the text and whether to clear it. These are separate actions.
{% if parallel_tools and native_tools %}
- Batch multiple tool calls in one response when targets are visible and won't move. Use separate responses when an action may change the screen. After batching, verify the outcome from the updated state.
{% elif parallel_tools %}
- Batch multiple tool calls in one <function_calls> block when targets are visible and won't move. Use separate calls when an action may change the screen. After batching, verify the outcome from the updated state.
{% else %}
- Prefer one tool call per response so you can observe the result before acting again
{% endif %}
- Use `complete` to signal task completion (success or failure)
- Before leaving a screen with facts you need later, include those facts in your reasoning so they appear in recent action history.
